      "node_id": "kg_doc_10",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "\"Computech\" is a single from the Norwegian band Turbonegro released on cassette tape in 1989. It was recorded at the first Turbonegro rehearsal in January 1989 and only 50 copies (some say 100) were made. The single was titled after the cheap Commodore computer cassettes that they were copied onto.",
      "depth": 0,
      "parent_id": null,
